  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Against Hei tribe’s incomplete ancient battle formation Green City Rampage, a lump of fire appears on the green giant, turns into a blazing flame, and engulfs it until the hill-like giant is an orange pillar of fire. Inside the burning, the giant can barely move. The four elders are shocked that they cannot tell when they were hit, that even Green City Rampage cannot break free for the time being, and that there were no hints of the move being used.",
      "chapters": [
        942
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_hei_tribe",
        "move_green_city_rampage"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It forms a combo immortal killer move with angry bird. Two or more immortal killer moves used one after another have stronger power through synergy. She first crashes angry bird into the green giant’s chest, leaving temporary fire path dao marks, then uses those dao marks as the basis to unleash fire prison, elevating its power and trapping the giant. If a long time had passed, or if she had activated fire prison first, the four elders could dodge during the activation, and the prison would not be as strong.",
      "chapters": [
        942
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan judges that designing a combo immortal killer move requires great grandmaster attainment, and that her fire path has reached that level. The green giant spews green fog that puts the fire out. The combo does not last ten breaths of time before it completely disintegrates, but it still costs the elders some time.",
      "chapters": [
        942
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
